WEBVTT

00:15:58.371 --> 00:16:00.912
So, you know, Indigenous diet

00:16:00.954 --> 00:16:03.037
is really the most ideal diet.

00:16:03.079 --> 00:16:04.329
It's healthy fats.

00:16:04.371 --> 00:16:07.162
It's diverse proteins,
it's low carbs, it's low salt.

00:16:07.204 --> 00:16:10.871
It's a ton of plant diversity.
It's organic agriculture.

00:16:10.912 --> 00:16:14.329
It's celebrating cultural
and regional diversity.

00:16:14.371 --> 00:16:15.704
And it's seasonal.

00:16:15.746 --> 00:16:16.996
It's just really good.

00:16:17.037 --> 00:16:19.287
It's like what the paleo diet
wishes it was,

00:16:19.329 --> 00:16:20.621
when it comes down to it,

00:16:20.662 --> 00:16:24.037
because that just makes sense,
you know, and we need to protect this.

00:16:24.079 --> 00:16:25.537
We need to get this out there.

00:16:25.579 --> 00:16:27.162
And again, it's not unique here.

00:16:27.204 --> 00:16:29.412
There's Indigenous peoples
all around the world

00:16:29.454 --> 00:16:31.412
and there's an Indigenous knowledge base